pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: nav-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 40]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: nav-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 0, 400, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$white"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>02 解决这个问题的难点</p>
  - elementId: page-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 55, 900, 40]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>难点二：PC 和指针都不自带上下文</strong></p>
  - elementId: gap-table
    elementType: table
    bounds: [60, 110, 1160, 420]
    columnWidths: [0.2, 0.35, 0.45]
    rowHeights: [0.1, 0.15, 0.15, 0.15, 0.15, 0.15, 0.15]
    style: "$default"
    rows:
      - - content: {text: "Gap 类型"}
        - content: {text: "具体表现"}
        - content: {text: "需要补齐的内容"}
      - - content: {text: "PC → Binary"}
        - content: {text: "PC 值不说明属于哪个 ELF"}
        - content: {text: "目标 ELF 精确映射 code map (sections, symbols, build-id)"}
      - - content: {text: "PC → Function"}
        - content: {text: "PC 值不说明函数名"}
        - content: {text: "Symbol table + debug line info"}
      - - content: {text: "PC → Process"}
        - content: {text: "PC 不说明属于 target child 还是 runner parent"}
        - content: {text: "Runtime OS map (/proc/pid/maps, exe)"}
      - - content: {text: "Pointer → String"}
        - content: {text: "ARG_MEM 只给 bytes 片段"}
        - content: {text: "截断前缀 + 外部补充验证基准"}
      - - content: {text: "ASLR/PIE"}
        - content: {text: "同一 binary 不同运行时 PC 不同"}
        - content: {text: "load_base offset + /proc/self/maps"}
      - - content: {text: "fork/exec"}
        - content: {text: "进程切换后 owner 变化"}
        - content: {text: "fork/exec event tracking + parent-child map"}
  - elementId: bottom-note-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 545, 1160, 80]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [6000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "#FEF3C7"
  - elementId: bottom-note-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 555, 1120, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p>必须引入两种外部上下文：<strong>目标 ELF 精确映射 code map</strong>（静态分析）和 <strong>Runtime OS map</strong>（/proc/pid/maps）。对于 PIE/ASLR/动态库/fork-exec 链，光有静态 ELF 是不够的。</p>
  - elementId: footer
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 680, 400, 30]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>RV-MalTrace 深度技术汇报</p>
  - elementId: page-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1180, 680, 60, 30]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>10</p>
